{"id":642,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"大学附属の環境で探究力を伸ばす教育","feature_description":"大学附属の環境で探究力を伸ばす教育を教育の核に据え、教科の学びと学校生活を結び付けながら、生徒が自ら考え行動する力を育てます。基礎となる知識や技能を着実に身に付けるとともに、探究、対話、行事、部活動などの経験を通して、多様な仲間と協働し課題に向き合います。一人ひとりが目標を見つけ、学びを深め、社会や世界に関わる視野を広げられるよう支える教育です。","clubs":[{"id":11971,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11972,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11973,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11974,"name":"ソフトテニス（男）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11975,"name":"ソフトテニス（女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11976,"name":"バレーボール（女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11977,"name":"バスケットボール（男）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11978,"name":"バスケットボール（女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11979,"name":"アンサンブル","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11980,"name":"演劇","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fzk.ed.shizuoka.ac.jp/hamachu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/04/annai